# Mobile (Capacitor) -- node_modules and Xcode's per-user/build state only.
# mobile/www is committed (generated by scripts/export_static.py, small and
# static -- no need to require Python+Django just to get the native project
# building on a fresh Mac checkout). mobile/ios is committed once you run
# `npx cap add ios` on the Mac, per normal Capacitor practice.
mobile/node_modules/
mobile/ios/App/Pods/
mobile/ios/App/build/
mobile/ios/DerivedData/
*.xcuserstate
xcuserdata/
